  "details": "Put the ability to edit the colours etc the same way you have when you are putting the accessory on, so you can preview what are all the options before buying the accessory.\n\n- This will provide users more motivation to purchase the accessory, when they can try out all the options befoe they buy\n\n- Some options are not clearly visible on the preview screenshots, due to low resolution. This way users can see everything. For example the collar does not show clearly if I can toggle off the paw accessory, the text is impossible to read on the options screenshot\n\nProvided screenshot is where I want the options to be displayed, so users can test them out",
